1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,626
We're here in response to the accident

2
00:00:02,626 --> 00:00:03,938
that happened
in the set of Joyce Trinidad's film.

3
00:00:03,938 --> 00:00:05,806
Wait, Deedee couldn't possibly do
what you're thinking.

4
00:00:05,806 --> 00:00:07,132
She's innocent!

5
00:00:07,132 --> 00:00:12,666
That's how I can protect myself
from Joyce's revelation.

6
00:00:12,667 --> 00:00:14,635
Is that how easy it is for you, Dad?

7
00:00:14,635 --> 00:00:16,003
Isn't that what you want, too?

8
00:00:16,003 --> 00:00:17,817
To eliminate that woman?

9
00:00:17,818 --> 00:00:19,172
We'll get through this.

10
00:00:19,173 --> 00:00:20,708
What happened to my daughter?

11
00:00:20,708 --> 00:00:23,311
You can only talk to me decently
if my daughter is okay.

12
00:00:23,311 --> 00:00:25,579
If something happens to my daughter,

13
00:00:25,579 --> 00:00:27,848
I will blame no one else but you!

14
00:00:27,848 --> 00:00:30,985
4:46 AM, time of death.

15
00:00:30,985 --> 00:00:34,221
No, no, no, no.

16
00:00:53,211 --> 00:00:57,291
I am my daughter's number one fan.

17
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:01,119
She would look for me in the audience

18
00:01:01,119 --> 00:01:03,855
when she competes in beauty pageants.

19
00:01:03,855 --> 00:01:07,125
And she'd cry.
She'd cry when she couldn't find me.

20
00:01:08,584 --> 00:01:13,439
She said... She said I was...

21
00:01:15,265 --> 00:01:17,158
I was her lucky charm.

22
00:01:17,158 --> 00:01:19,760
That's why she would always win.

23
00:01:21,902 --> 00:01:24,313
But I wonder...

24
00:01:26,290 --> 00:01:34,987
if I actually bring bad luck into her life?

25
00:01:34,987 --> 00:01:35,921
Uncle...

26
00:01:35,921 --> 00:01:39,065
Why did I have to come see her at work
on the set?

27
00:01:39,065 --> 00:01:44,563
Why did I tell her what I knew?

28
00:01:44,563 --> 00:01:46,365
I got her involved.

29
00:01:46,365 --> 00:01:49,500
I dragged her into this mess!

30
00:01:53,092 --> 00:01:55,761
Uncle...

31
00:01:56,508 --> 00:02:02,154
My dear Joyce died
carrying that burden in her heart.

32
00:02:07,785 --> 00:02:11,722
Uncle Edmond, what do you mean?
What did you tell Joyce?

33
00:02:36,281 --> 00:02:37,817
Love...

34
00:02:40,986 --> 00:02:47,465
I know it must be devastating
for you and the whole team.

35
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:08,240
I'm already scheduled...
to talk with the police.

36
00:03:13,652 --> 00:03:18,256
Everyone else has already been interrogated.

37
00:03:20,959 --> 00:03:23,762
I feel bad for Deedee.

38
00:03:23,762 --> 00:03:27,504
She's now the main suspect.

39
00:03:30,001 --> 00:03:34,816
Love, you never know, right? Maybe...

40
00:03:36,541 --> 00:03:42,948
Maybe the police are just overly suspicious
of everyone.

41
00:03:42,948 --> 00:03:45,971
But maybe...

42
00:03:45,971 --> 00:03:49,454
it's just a simple case of neglect, right?

43
00:03:49,454 --> 00:03:52,524
Maybe they overlooked the gun.

44
00:03:52,524 --> 00:03:57,180
Maybe they didn't change the bullets, right?

45
00:03:59,231 --> 00:04:01,673
- That's all there is to it.
- Via...

46
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:07,594
Via, it's so painful.

47
00:04:09,141 --> 00:04:10,766
So much.

48
00:04:12,744 --> 00:04:14,938
It hurts so much.

49
00:04:18,427 --> 00:04:20,417
Via...

50
00:04:23,689 --> 00:04:27,181
there's no one else to blame but me.

51
00:04:31,663 --> 00:04:33,720
Via, because...

52
00:04:36,268 --> 00:04:38,751
We were already separated.

53
00:04:40,505 --> 00:04:42,908
We've been apart.

54
00:04:44,843 --> 00:04:46,628
But I...

55
00:04:47,569 --> 00:04:53,823
I insisted on working with her.

56
00:04:58,423 --> 00:05:06,056
If only... I didn't come back to her life.

57
00:05:09,412 --> 00:05:11,119
I wish...

58
00:05:12,871 --> 00:05:16,795
I wish her life would have been different.

59
00:05:18,131 --> 00:05:21,512
I wish I had avoided her.

60
00:05:23,682 --> 00:05:26,117
What are you saying?

61
00:05:26,117 --> 00:05:29,092
This is all my fault.

62
00:05:30,754 --> 00:05:32,342
It's all my fault.

63
00:05:32,342 --> 00:05:34,025
No.

64
00:05:34,025 --> 00:05:36,761
Liam, no.

65
00:05:36,761 --> 00:05:38,417
It's not you.

66
00:05:39,731 --> 00:05:42,834
It's not your fault. It's not you.

67
00:05:42,834 --> 00:05:44,573
It's not you.

68
00:05:59,417 --> 00:06:03,355
Dad saw this video. And he knows him.

69
00:06:03,355 --> 00:06:06,191
Where's Uncle Edmond? Can I talk to him?

70
00:06:06,191 --> 00:06:08,526
It will help my investigation.

71
00:06:08,526 --> 00:06:12,329
- Let's go and see him.
- You can't talk to him, Hans.

72
00:06:13,064 --> 00:06:17,160
You can't do that
with his condition right now.

73
00:06:21,129 --> 00:06:24,075
Uncle, calm down.

74
00:06:24,075 --> 00:06:26,811
Whatever it was that you told her,

75
00:06:26,811 --> 00:06:30,115
it was not your fault, Uncle.

76
00:06:30,115 --> 00:06:32,550
Joyce would not want
to see you like that, Uncle.

77
00:06:32,550 --> 00:06:35,920
I'm sure she wants you
to be in good condition.

78
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:38,390
Calm down, okay?

79
00:06:38,390 --> 00:06:43,696
That kid always thinks about me.

80
00:06:53,338 --> 00:06:56,408
Honestly, you should talk to Liam Herrera.

81
00:06:56,408 --> 00:06:58,410
I wonder why you're talking to Blacksmith.

82
00:06:58,410 --> 00:07:01,038
They all left me.

83
00:07:01,038 --> 00:07:04,449
That's the reason why
you're a person of interest.

84
00:07:04,449 --> 00:07:06,910
Because you have a motive to be angry
at your employees

85
00:07:06,910 --> 00:07:10,822
who joined Liam and Joyce's production.

86
00:07:10,822 --> 00:07:12,023
Okay, fine.

87
00:07:12,023 --> 00:07:14,391
Start the interrogation
so we can get this over and done with.

88
00:07:14,391 --> 00:07:17,284
This is just an initial investigation.

89
00:07:17,284 --> 00:07:21,800
We couldn't talk to them on the set
because it was chaotic,

90
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:25,437
and everyone was already emotional.

91
00:07:25,437 --> 00:07:30,804
Sir Vergil, sorry for getting you involved.

92
00:07:33,044 --> 00:07:35,947
Okay, Police Officer Cruz.

93
00:07:35,947 --> 00:07:39,317
We're willing to cooperate.

94
00:07:39,317 --> 00:07:43,128
I feel sorry for Deedee.

95
00:07:43,128 --> 00:07:46,658
She's like a sister to me.

96
00:07:46,658 --> 00:07:50,395
She's been receiving death threats already...

97
00:07:50,395 --> 00:07:51,815
from angry fans.

98
00:07:51,815 --> 00:07:54,966
Her family is getting dragged into it, too.

99
00:07:54,966 --> 00:07:57,235
We were okay on the set.

100
00:07:57,235 --> 00:08:00,739
It was not an inside job or foul play.

101
00:08:00,739 --> 00:08:03,541
No one would deliberately kill Joyce.

102
00:08:03,541 --> 00:08:05,443
Right, Director Phil?

103
00:08:06,611 --> 00:08:08,713
What now, Director Phil?

104
00:08:08,713 --> 00:08:11,209
Why are you suddenly speechless?

105
00:08:13,016 --> 00:08:17,322
Do you think
I don't know what you say about me?

106
00:08:17,322 --> 00:08:21,345
That I still hold a grudge against Joyce?

107
00:08:22,293 --> 00:08:26,231
I know you think I was behind what happened.

108
00:08:26,231 --> 00:08:30,101
Maxine, I didn't say anything like that.

109
00:08:30,101 --> 00:08:31,770
We're in front of police officers.

110
00:08:31,770 --> 00:08:33,805
You know that's oral defamation.

111
00:08:33,805 --> 00:08:35,407
Stop arguing.

112
00:08:35,407 --> 00:08:37,809
We keep Hernandez under our custody

113
00:08:37,809 --> 00:08:40,445
because her family requested it.

114
00:08:40,445 --> 00:08:44,015
You said so yourself.
This case is high profile.

115
00:08:44,015 --> 00:08:46,684
And she has received
a lot of death threats already.

116
00:08:46,684 --> 00:08:51,555
Unless someone else is willing
to get detained too.

117
00:09:00,298 --> 00:09:01,533
Okay.

118
00:09:01,533 --> 00:09:05,987
We'll just keep you updated
with developments in our investigation.

119
00:09:19,167 --> 00:09:27,000
[Photos]

120
00:09:48,028 --> 00:09:49,780
Son.

121
00:09:55,186 --> 00:09:59,978
Are you ashamed to show me
that you're crying for Joyce?

122
00:10:10,201 --> 00:10:11,863
No, Mom.

123
00:10:15,507 --> 00:10:17,793
I feel guilty.

124
00:10:20,545 --> 00:10:23,184
I feel guilty because...

125
00:10:25,950 --> 00:10:29,175
maybe I'm making Via feel...

126
00:10:31,663 --> 00:10:35,105
that I'm sorry for losing Joyce.

127
00:10:38,429 --> 00:10:45,583
She might think that I'm being insensitive.

128
00:10:48,135 --> 00:10:49,755
But, Mom...

129
00:10:52,777 --> 00:10:55,623
I can't help it.

130
00:10:57,949 --> 00:11:00,124
I can't help it.

131
00:11:02,654 --> 00:11:05,956
I can't help but get hurt.

132
00:11:09,494 --> 00:11:10,983
Son.

133
00:11:14,566 --> 00:11:19,859
There's nothing wrong about mourning.

134
00:11:26,144 --> 00:11:28,002
You know what?

135
00:11:30,515 --> 00:11:32,670
You're my son.

136
00:11:34,752 --> 00:11:39,026
I'll be the last one to judge you.

137
00:11:44,662 --> 00:11:48,145
Is there something you wish to tell me?

138
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:05,061
The day...

139
00:12:07,027 --> 00:12:09,395
that Joyce died...

140
00:12:12,886 --> 00:12:19,309
I told her I love her, Mom.

141
00:12:27,972 --> 00:12:33,461
Joyce... I want to tell you something.

142
00:12:35,013 --> 00:12:36,883
I love you.

143
00:12:42,987 --> 00:12:44,745
I'm sorry.

144
00:12:46,424 --> 00:12:48,098
I'm sorry.

145
00:12:50,928 --> 00:12:54,732
Why are you apologizing, son?

146
00:12:54,732 --> 00:13:02,740
Because I know that you're hurting for Via.

147
00:13:09,347 --> 00:13:11,416
You know what, son?

148
00:13:11,416 --> 00:13:20,949
I reminded you
that Via was your girlfriend...

149
00:13:23,695 --> 00:13:32,070
because I knew
you have been feeling something else.

150
00:13:40,157 --> 00:13:42,806
Son, I was...

151
00:13:44,482 --> 00:13:50,017
I was pushing Via to you because...

152
00:13:52,266 --> 00:13:56,051
Because I don't want her to end up like me.

153
00:13:56,052 --> 00:14:00,371
Someone who got neglected.

154
00:14:03,807 --> 00:14:10,826
But I forgot to check...

155
00:14:12,479 --> 00:14:15,313
what you really felt.

156
00:14:22,286 --> 00:14:24,826
I'm sorry, son...

157
00:14:28,426 --> 00:14:38,436
if I stopped you from being happy

158
00:14:38,436 --> 00:14:40,756
and choosing what you really want.

159
00:14:43,855 --> 00:14:47,678
Now it's too late.

160
00:14:49,881 --> 00:14:52,531
Even though...

161
00:14:54,026 --> 00:14:58,189
I wasn't able to tell her sooner...

162
00:14:59,957 --> 00:15:03,267
I hope
that after everything we'd been through...

163
00:15:04,162 --> 00:15:11,032
After everything we learned
from each other...

164
00:15:13,329 --> 00:15:19,431
while fulfilling each other's
dreams together...

165
00:15:24,609 --> 00:15:32,104
I hope I got to make her feel my love...

166
00:15:33,558 --> 00:15:36,284
That I love her so much.

167
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:45,569
Oh, son...

168
00:16:24,868 --> 00:16:31,734
[In Memoriam, Joyce, 1995-2022]

169
00:16:50,601 --> 00:16:53,865
Boss, can I ask you something?

170
00:16:53,865 --> 00:16:58,142
Where's the man
who lives on the other corner?

171
00:16:58,142 --> 00:16:59,310
Who?

172
00:16:59,310 --> 00:17:00,945
The homeless man?

173
00:17:00,945 --> 00:17:02,280
He's no longer there.

174
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:05,783
The authorities forced him to relocate.

175
00:17:05,783 --> 00:17:08,404
It's really illegal to stay there.

176
00:17:09,820 --> 00:17:11,455
Is that so?

177
00:17:11,455 --> 00:17:13,257
Okay, thank you so much.

178
00:17:13,257 --> 00:17:14,471
Okay.

179
00:17:24,168 --> 00:17:25,436
Let me have some of it.

180
00:17:25,436 --> 00:17:28,315
Get out of here! You stink!

181
00:17:33,110 --> 00:17:34,920
Hey, that's mine!

182
00:17:41,886 --> 00:17:44,154
Your girlfriend doesn't love you!

183
00:18:22,534 --> 00:18:25,467
[40 days later]

184
00:18:28,032 --> 00:18:33,170
Please, pray for us.
Hail, Virgin Mary, conceived without sin.

185
00:18:33,170 --> 00:18:38,107
Please, pray for us.
Hail, Virgin Mary, conceived without sin.

186
00:18:38,107 --> 00:18:42,845
Please, pray for us.
Hail, Virgin Mary, conceived without sin.

187
00:18:42,845 --> 00:18:48,185
In the name
of the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit.

188
00:18:49,212 --> 00:18:50,538
Coffee.

189
00:18:50,538 --> 00:18:52,873
Thank you.

190
00:18:53,524 --> 00:18:55,650
Days have gone by so fast.

191
00:18:55,650 --> 00:18:58,829
It has been 40 days since Joyce passed away.

192
00:19:00,965 --> 00:19:03,745
I still can't accept it.

193
00:19:09,272 --> 00:19:12,542
I've been crying for 40 days.

194
00:19:12,542 --> 00:19:16,779
I will probably cry until tomorrow.

195
00:19:16,779 --> 00:19:19,914
I don't know how long I will cry.

196
00:19:24,854 --> 00:19:27,857
Joyce!

197
00:19:29,926 --> 00:19:34,830
She's like a sister to me.

198
00:19:44,473 --> 00:19:46,601
Odet.

199
00:19:50,713 --> 00:19:52,648
Odet.

200
00:19:52,648 --> 00:19:54,812
Why, Madam?

201
00:19:56,429 --> 00:19:59,929
Please show them the way out.

202
00:19:59,929 --> 00:20:06,328
Odet, they might think you're a relative.

203
00:20:07,764 --> 00:20:13,441
Madam, even though Joyce and I
were not related by blood,

204
00:20:13,441 --> 00:20:18,656
I still treated her like family.

205
00:20:21,244 --> 00:20:22,445
This way to the exit.

206
00:20:22,445 --> 00:20:23,679
Let's go.

207
00:20:23,679 --> 00:20:25,320
This way.

208
00:20:27,450 --> 00:20:29,374
Come on.

209
00:20:31,922 --> 00:20:34,852
Madam, please leave the coffee here.
It's bad luck.

210
00:20:34,852 --> 00:20:37,454
You can't take it with you.

211
00:20:42,298 --> 00:20:44,039
This way.

212
00:21:01,284 --> 00:21:04,654
This is the last of Joyce's stuff
in her old room.

213
00:21:05,888 --> 00:21:09,243
Are we going to bury it, too?

214
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:21,070
This is the first gown she bought
from her savings.

215
00:21:21,070 --> 00:21:23,921
She wore this in several competitions.

216
00:21:32,181 --> 00:21:33,416
You know what?

217
00:21:33,416 --> 00:21:36,752
She couldn't sleep without this.

218
00:21:38,521 --> 00:21:41,904
I can still smell her scent.

219
00:21:52,935 --> 00:21:55,068
What else is here?

220
00:22:00,509 --> 00:22:02,611
What do I do with her cell phone?

221
00:22:02,611 --> 00:22:04,380
I don't know her password.

222
00:22:04,380 --> 00:22:06,359
I can't access it.

223
00:22:07,183 --> 00:22:10,484
I'm sure she has lots of memories here.

224
00:22:12,555 --> 00:22:14,924
Can I borrow it, Auntie?

225
00:22:14,924 --> 00:22:16,635
Okay.

226
00:22:30,272 --> 00:22:32,815
How did you unlock it?

227
00:22:39,315 --> 00:22:45,093
Auntie, when I was courting Joyce,

228
00:22:48,591 --> 00:22:54,403
she asked that we exchange passwords...

229
00:22:56,766 --> 00:23:00,269
until she could return my feelings.

230
00:23:00,269 --> 00:23:03,546
That way, we can be assured
that we're not entertaining other people.

231
00:23:11,580 --> 00:23:14,002
But, Auntie...

232
00:23:18,710 --> 00:23:23,793
we never checked each other's phones.

233
00:23:23,793 --> 00:23:26,401
Because I trust her.

234
00:23:28,798 --> 00:23:31,698
And I know that she trusts me too.

235
00:23:36,038 --> 00:23:39,940
I'm the only one who meddled in her life.

236
00:23:42,044 --> 00:23:44,698
I love your daughter so much.

237
00:23:56,158 --> 00:23:58,527
My daughter is so beautiful.

238
00:23:58,527 --> 00:24:01,757
She's so beautiful.

239
00:24:07,036 --> 00:24:10,672
You two look so good together.

240
00:24:12,562 --> 00:24:15,107
You look so good together.

241
00:24:31,594 --> 00:24:34,182
<i>I'm recording this...</i>

242
00:24:36,281 --> 00:24:38,634
<i>in case something happens to me,</i>

243
00:24:38,634 --> 00:24:41,837
<i>because of the information I have.</i>

244
00:24:41,837 --> 00:24:44,273
<i>Hans, I know you have access to my phone.</i>

245
00:24:44,273 --> 00:24:46,475
<i>I know you can unlock this.</i>

246
00:24:46,475 --> 00:24:51,113
<i>I have crucial information about the case</i>

247
00:24:51,113 --> 00:24:53,082
<i>you're investigating in Casa Fuerte.</i>

248
00:24:53,082 --> 00:24:56,625
<i>About the construction worker who died.</i>

249
00:24:57,920 --> 00:25:00,155
<i>This is about Lando, the suspect,</i>

250
00:25:00,155 --> 00:25:03,485
<i>and his boss, Congressman Ramon dela Peña.</i>

251
00:25:47,104 --> 00:25:51,140
If you keep doing your job well
until I become the President...

252
00:25:51,140 --> 00:25:54,223
I'll take care of you, my friend.

253
00:25:59,915 --> 00:26:01,493
Don't try to fight.

254
00:26:01,493 --> 00:26:02,992
Put your hands up.

255
00:26:10,057 --> 00:26:12,245
Go on. Put handcuffs on them.

256
00:26:37,651 --> 00:26:41,014
Attorney Hans, everything is fine now.

257
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:46,128
Don't move!

258
00:26:46,128 --> 00:26:47,423
Put your hands up!

259
00:26:47,423 --> 00:26:49,765
You're caught red-handed.

260
00:26:49,765 --> 00:26:51,624
What's the meaning of this?

261
00:26:52,606 --> 00:26:54,945
We'll explain at the police station.

262
00:27:00,244 --> 00:27:02,773
What will happen to us now?

263
00:27:05,882 --> 00:27:09,219
I think I'm going to lie low for now.

264
00:27:09,219 --> 00:27:14,286
I'm still waiting for Boss Bro's call.

265
00:27:15,392 --> 00:27:17,327
<i>I have nothing to do
with all your accusations.</i>

266
00:27:17,327 --> 00:27:18,300
Watch this.

267
00:27:18,300 --> 00:27:20,199
<i>We'll talk at the police station!</i>

268
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:20,868
[Blacksmith Productions involved
in Joyce's murder?]

269
00:27:20,868 --> 00:27:22,940
<i>Hey, be careful!</i>

270
00:27:22,941 --> 00:27:26,969
<i>It's been 40 days
since Joyce Trinidad passed away.</i>

271
00:27:26,970 --> 00:27:31,174
<i>And there's a big revelation
that can give justice to her death.</i>

272
00:27:31,174 --> 00:27:36,580
<i>After 40 days,
a video recording was found by her mother,</i>

273
00:27:36,580 --> 00:27:41,484
<i>where Joyce revealed her alleged killer.</i>

274
00:27:41,484 --> 00:27:43,968
<i>It is said
that behind Joyce's murder</i>

275
00:27:43,968 --> 00:27:49,258
<i>is a bigger crime connected
to the illegal business of a syndicate</i>

276
00:27:49,258 --> 00:27:52,562
<i>allegedly headed
by Congressman Ramon dela Peña.</i>

277
00:27:52,562 --> 00:27:54,675
What's going on?

278
00:27:57,601 --> 00:28:01,037
<i>This involved the companies
that the congressman had invested in.</i>

279
00:28:01,037 --> 00:28:01,799
<i>That includes</i>

280
00:28:01,800 --> 00:28:05,766
<i>the Herrera Group of Companies,
Casa Fuerte Properties,</i>

281
00:28:05,767 --> 00:28:09,245
<i>Blacksmith Productions, and many others.</i>

282
00:28:10,853 --> 00:28:13,283
Son...

283
00:28:13,283 --> 00:28:14,800
Your dad...

284
00:28:14,800 --> 00:28:16,681
Is Danilo...

285
00:28:18,939 --> 00:28:21,434
Is Danilo involved in it?

286
00:28:24,970 --> 00:28:29,457
Is he working with the people
who killed Joyce?

287
00:28:32,736 --> 00:28:34,192
My God.

288
00:28:35,972 --> 00:28:37,907
But, son...

289
00:28:37,907 --> 00:28:41,489
You don't know about that, right?

290
00:28:43,079 --> 00:28:46,916
You have no knowledge
of Casa Fuerte's illegal dealings

291
00:28:46,916 --> 00:28:51,920
because you're no longer there, right?

292
00:28:51,920 --> 00:28:54,822
You have nothing to do with it, right, son?

293
00:28:59,129 --> 00:29:00,397
Deedee!

294
00:29:00,397 --> 00:29:02,302
- Dee!
- Dee.

295
00:29:07,421 --> 00:29:09,373
The truth is out.

296
00:29:12,056 --> 00:29:14,968
We already know who killed Miss Joyce.

297
00:29:18,881 --> 00:29:22,019
Until the last moment,

298
00:29:22,019 --> 00:29:27,325
Miss Joyce has helped you clear your name.

299
00:29:27,325 --> 00:29:32,109
I'm happy
that Miss Joyce got the justice she deserved.

300
00:29:43,841 --> 00:29:45,481
Liam.

301
00:29:46,510 --> 00:29:48,004
Son...

302
00:29:50,448 --> 00:29:51,682
Tell me.

303
00:29:51,682 --> 00:29:54,718
You don't know about it, do you?

304
00:29:57,521 --> 00:29:59,340
Son...

305
00:31:13,412 --> 00:31:16,400
<i>There's no one to blame but me.</i>

306
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:18,235
We were already separated from each other.

307
00:31:18,235 --> 00:31:25,042
I insisted on working with her again.

308
00:31:25,042 --> 00:31:30,715
If only I didn't return to her life,

309
00:31:30,715 --> 00:31:34,679
things would have been different.

310
00:31:35,882 --> 00:31:38,695
This is my fault.

311
00:31:38,695 --> 00:31:40,429
It's not you.

312
00:31:41,726 --> 00:31:44,371
Not you, not you.

313
00:31:44,371 --> 00:31:46,457
I'm sorry, Love.

314
00:31:47,316 --> 00:31:49,457
I'm sorry, Liam.

315
00:31:51,231 --> 00:31:53,771
- I'm sorry.
- <i>Isn't that what you also want?</i>

316
00:31:53,771 --> 00:31:56,104
<i>Deep inside your heart...</i>

317
00:31:56,104 --> 00:31:57,908
<i>To get rid of that woman.</i>

318
00:31:57,908 --> 00:32:02,130
<i>To get rid of that woman,
isn't that what you want, too?</i>

319
00:32:05,750 --> 00:32:07,665
No, no, no.

320
00:32:08,550 --> 00:32:12,323
No, no, no!

321
00:32:12,323 --> 00:32:14,704
No.

322
00:32:22,689 --> 00:32:25,001
- Dad.
- Son.

323
00:32:30,563 --> 00:32:32,915
I'm sorry.

324
00:32:32,915 --> 00:32:35,298
I hope you can forgive me.

325
00:32:37,282 --> 00:32:41,376
I couldn't break free from Ramon.

326
00:32:42,337 --> 00:32:44,579
I couldn't do what you did.

327
00:32:45,735 --> 00:32:47,329
Dad...

328
00:32:49,693 --> 00:32:52,587
It's my fault...

329
00:32:54,363 --> 00:32:56,433
that you're here.

330
00:32:59,778 --> 00:33:02,423
Everything started with me.

331
00:33:05,769 --> 00:33:07,994
What pains me more...

332
00:33:11,348 --> 00:33:14,656
is knowing I'm the reason Joyce died.

333
00:33:17,688 --> 00:33:20,253
Congressman Ramon targeted her...

334
00:33:22,763 --> 00:33:25,323
because of what she knew.

335
00:33:26,428 --> 00:33:33,137
That monster did
what he had threatened to do.

336
00:33:33,137 --> 00:33:35,681
If only I knew...

337
00:33:35,681 --> 00:33:38,831
If only I knew, I could have done something
before he could make a move.

338
00:33:41,128 --> 00:33:43,862
I am more culpable than you are.

339
00:33:44,831 --> 00:33:48,052
Ramon is in your life because of me.

340
00:33:48,052 --> 00:33:50,448
Dad, no.

341
00:33:52,823 --> 00:33:55,426
I'm willing to pay for all my sins.

342
00:33:55,426 --> 00:33:57,323
I'll take responsibility for it.

343
00:35:21,276 --> 00:35:24,324
Save yourself.

344
00:35:24,324 --> 00:35:27,750
What will happen to your mom
if you go to jail?

345
00:35:27,750 --> 00:35:30,453
You have nothing to do with these cases.

346
00:35:30,453 --> 00:35:32,934
I'll own up to everything.

347
00:35:36,403 --> 00:35:37,817
Liam...

348
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:41,981
I have lots of shortcomings as your father.

349
00:35:45,380 --> 00:35:49,139
I couldn't take responsibility
for you and your mother,

350
00:35:49,140 --> 00:35:52,201
even though Tess is the one I really love.

351
00:35:54,477 --> 00:35:58,981
I forced myself to be with my wife and Vergil

352
00:35:58,981 --> 00:36:02,333
even though we weren't happy.

353
00:36:03,286 --> 00:36:06,958
I couldn't follow my heart.

354
00:36:07,957 --> 00:36:15,185
So now, let me be a father to you
the way I know how.

355
00:36:19,502 --> 00:36:22,138
I'm begging you.

356
00:36:22,138 --> 00:36:24,787
Do as I tell you.

357
00:36:28,211 --> 00:36:30,643
Just let me be.

358
00:36:32,548 --> 00:36:35,096
I'll take full responsibility.

359
00:36:44,393 --> 00:36:46,892
Save yourself.

360
00:36:57,304 --> 00:36:58,541
Miss Via!

361
00:36:58,541 --> 00:37:01,233
Queenie here.

362
00:37:01,233 --> 00:37:02,897
Miss Via?

363
00:37:04,981 --> 00:37:06,749
Miss Via?

364
00:37:06,749 --> 00:37:09,384
I'm going in, okay?

365
00:37:10,319 --> 00:37:12,555
Miss Via.

366
00:37:16,726 --> 00:37:19,885
Miss Via.

367
00:37:21,430 --> 00:37:23,065
Miss Via.

368
00:37:23,065 --> 00:37:25,098
Miss Via!

369
00:37:29,439 --> 00:37:34,871
Miss Via.

370
00:37:36,078 --> 00:37:38,192
Miss Via!

371
00:38:06,375 --> 00:38:08,411
What's that?

372
00:38:08,411 --> 00:38:12,481
Holy crap. I don't read such things.

373
00:38:12,481 --> 00:38:15,406
Don't you have any sexy magazines?

374
00:38:15,406 --> 00:38:17,053
Here you go, boss.

375
00:38:17,053 --> 00:38:18,621
There.

376
00:38:18,621 --> 00:38:20,718
That's what I'm talking about.

377
00:39:21,952 --> 00:39:23,425
Via...

378
00:39:24,620 --> 00:39:26,504
How are you?

379
00:39:27,857 --> 00:39:30,326
Do you need anything?

380
00:39:30,326 --> 00:39:32,340
Are you hungry?

381
00:39:33,996 --> 00:39:35,865
Stay in bed for now.

382
00:39:35,865 --> 00:39:38,364
I'll take care of everything.

383
00:39:42,338 --> 00:39:44,873
Why did you do that?

384
00:39:47,043 --> 00:39:51,023
Good thing Queenie helped you
cough out those pills.

385
00:40:01,157 --> 00:40:04,148
I need to tell you something.

386
00:40:08,244 --> 00:40:10,249
I'm sorry.

387
00:40:12,368 --> 00:40:13,602
For what?

388
00:40:13,602 --> 00:40:15,824
Sorry for what?

389
00:40:15,824 --> 00:40:17,898
I'm sorry, Liam.

390
00:40:21,911 --> 00:40:23,757
It's all my fault.

391
00:40:28,476 --> 00:40:31,062
It was me who told Dad.

392
00:40:33,222 --> 00:40:39,061
I told him about Joyce's discovery.

393
00:40:39,061 --> 00:40:41,530
I heard her.

394
00:40:41,530 --> 00:40:44,567
She was talking to her father.

395
00:40:44,567 --> 00:40:47,524
Her father knows a lot.

396
00:40:47,524 --> 00:40:51,073
He used to work for my dad.

397
00:40:51,073 --> 00:40:57,485
So he knows about all of
my dad's illegal dealings.

398
00:40:57,485 --> 00:40:59,023
Love...

399
00:41:03,986 --> 00:41:05,988
Sorry.

400
00:41:05,988 --> 00:41:08,129
It's my fault.

401
00:41:09,258 --> 00:41:13,996
I got scared.
I got scared that my dad would go to jail.

402
00:41:13,996 --> 00:41:18,267
So... so I told him about Joyce.

403
00:41:18,267 --> 00:41:20,102
I just got scared.

404
00:41:20,102 --> 00:41:23,272
I only wanted to protect my dad.

405
00:41:23,272 --> 00:41:25,183
I'm the reason...

406
00:41:26,275 --> 00:41:30,078
I'm the reason Joyce died.

407
00:41:36,452 --> 00:41:37,820
Liam.

408
00:41:37,820 --> 00:41:39,021
Liam...

409
00:41:39,021 --> 00:41:42,124
Liam, please forgive me.

410
00:41:42,124 --> 00:41:45,554
Sorry... Sorry.

411
00:41:46,829 --> 00:41:51,600
I know... I know you love Joyce, okay?

412
00:41:51,600 --> 00:41:57,440
I know you love her,
but I didn't intend for her to die.

413
00:41:57,440 --> 00:42:00,142
I didn't know that this would happen to her.

414
00:42:00,142 --> 00:42:01,310
I didn't know, Liam.

415
00:42:01,310 --> 00:42:04,146
I didn't know that this would happen.

416
00:42:04,146 --> 00:42:07,429
I only protected my dad, Liam.

417
00:42:08,651 --> 00:42:10,286
I thought he would go to jail.

418
00:42:10,286 --> 00:42:13,289
I didn't know.

419
00:42:13,289 --> 00:42:15,658
I didn't want this to happen, Love.

420
00:42:15,658 --> 00:42:18,660
Forgive me, please. I'm sorry.

421
00:42:18,660 --> 00:42:22,164
I'm sorry, I'm sorry...

422
00:42:22,164 --> 00:42:24,365
I'm sorry.

423
00:42:26,092 --> 00:42:29,303
Please... Please.

424
00:42:29,303 --> 00:42:31,615
Please, Love.

425
00:42:33,642 --> 00:42:35,678
I really didn't know. Believe me.

426
00:42:35,678 --> 00:42:36,745
Please, believe me.

427
00:42:36,745 --> 00:42:38,047
I didn't know.

428
00:42:38,047 --> 00:42:41,350
I didn't know that would happen.
I didn't know.

429
00:42:41,350 --> 00:42:43,542
I didn't know.

430
00:42:46,655 --> 00:42:48,691
Please.

431
00:42:48,691 --> 00:42:50,206
Love...

432
00:43:09,634 --> 00:43:11,233
[Your warmth and shine
left the world a better place]

433
00:43:11,234 --> 00:43:12,822
[Joycelyn A Trinidad]
[Savana]

434
00:43:12,823 --> 00:43:18,363
It hurts when you love someone, right?

435
00:43:22,297 --> 00:43:24,367
Have you made up your mind, Boss Bro?

436
00:43:35,820 --> 00:43:37,781
Sorry, Borj.

437
00:43:41,544 --> 00:43:44,249
I am not the Boss Bro you think I am.

438
00:43:48,250 --> 00:43:51,155
I did bad things...

439
00:43:53,238 --> 00:43:56,250
that led to Joyce's death.

440
00:44:00,429 --> 00:44:03,554
I have no choice...

441
00:44:05,236 --> 00:44:07,510
but to take responsibility for everything.

442
00:44:11,440 --> 00:44:14,262
I tolerated...

443
00:44:17,665 --> 00:44:21,016
I tolerated the Congressman's illegal dealings
in Casa Fuerte.

444
00:44:24,153 --> 00:44:27,749
So I'm not innocent, Borj.

445
00:44:27,749 --> 00:44:30,466
Are you turning yourself in?

446
00:44:31,694 --> 00:44:33,935
Does Ma'am Tess know?

447
00:44:39,001 --> 00:44:42,833
Maybe I'll tell her when I get home.

448
00:44:45,174 --> 00:44:47,643
Do you want me to go with you?

449
00:44:47,643 --> 00:44:49,489
Borj...

450
00:44:52,521 --> 00:44:58,337
The help you can do for me right now...

451
00:45:01,023 --> 00:45:03,501
is to keep away from me.

452
00:45:05,027 --> 00:45:09,141
I won't let you get involved...

453
00:45:09,141 --> 00:45:11,621
when I turn myself in.

454
00:45:49,938 --> 00:45:51,438
Boss Bro...

455
00:45:54,076 --> 00:45:55,489
I promise...

456
00:46:00,267 --> 00:46:02,356
I will visit you often.

457
00:46:10,509 --> 00:46:12,285
Borj...

458
00:46:14,033 --> 00:46:15,504
Thank you.

459
00:46:45,227 --> 00:46:48,797
I guess it's time I man up.

460
00:46:48,797 --> 00:46:50,799
I want to be your wife.

461
00:46:50,799 --> 00:46:52,668
I'm so happy.

462
00:46:52,668 --> 00:46:55,337
So happy that it's overwhelming.

463
00:46:55,337 --> 00:47:00,409
I'm glad you accepted my offer
to work together again, Liam.

464
00:47:00,409 --> 00:47:02,077
I'm willing to work with you.

465
00:47:02,077 --> 00:47:03,812
What's your motive, Liam?

466
00:47:03,812 --> 00:47:06,348
What do you want to happen?
Why are you interested in this case?

467
00:47:06,348 --> 00:47:11,520
So that we can give justice
to Siloy's death and Uncle Edmond's blindness.

468
00:47:11,520 --> 00:47:12,521
What's...

469
00:47:12,521 --> 00:47:16,096
You're the man I always dream about.
